e town/place (not the mandi gate)"}],"routes":[{"slug":"dhanotu-kullu","path":[[76.9002,31.5509],[76.9081,31.572],[76.922,31.5869],[76.9241,31.6016],[76.9392,31.6166],[76.9472,31.6438],[76.9476,31.6776],[76.9353,31.6876],[76.9295,31.7115],[76.9484,31.7382],[76.9466,31.7478],[76.9522,31.7525],[76.9619,31.7473],[76.9765,31.7633],[76.9747,31.7702],[76.995,31.7847],[77.0055,31.7831],[77.0123,31.7979],[77.0484,31.7978],[77.0543,31.792],[77.0585,31.8016],[77.049,31.8025],[77.0717,31.8137],[77.0711,31.8203],[77.0801,31.8214],[77.075,31.8255],[77.0938,31.8338],[77.1153,31.8325],[77.1099,31.8201],[77.1349,31.8354],[77.1261,31.8387],[77.1601,31.847],[77.1509,31.8798],[77.1109,31.9376],[77.1086,31.9579]],"km":85.6,"hours":1.58,"provider":"router.project-osrm.org","profile":"driving (car)","truck_suitable":false,"requested":"2026-11-07T20:18:47Z"}],"scenes":[{"kind":"intro","headline":"October 2025","caption":"Dhanotu (Mandi) (Himachal Pradesh) and Kullu (Himachal Pradesh) both reported bottle gourd prices for the same variety and grade (FAQ) on 19 matched days.","camera":"corridor","focus":[679,675]},{"kind":"prices","headline":"Two markets, two prices","caption":"Dhanotu (Mandi) reported a median ₹2,750 per quintal. Kullu reported a median ₹3,800 around modeled arrival days. These are not offers.","camera":"corridor","focus":[679,675],"cards":[679,675]},{"kind":"gap","headline":"Gap ₹1,050/qtl","caption":"The median gap was ₹1,050 per quintal, and Kullu was dearer on 89% of days.","camera":"corridor","focus":[679,675],"chart":"gap"},{"kind":"route","headline":"86 km by road","caption":"86 km on OpenStreetMap roads (~2 hours by car). A loaded truck is slower, so we allow 1 days plus 7 days to get paid.","camera":"corridor","focus":[679,675],"route":"dhanotu-kullu","truck":true},{"kind":"costs","headline":"After modeled costs","caption":"Freight ≈₹18/qtl, 5% fees and commission, loading, 5% loss and interest. On the typical day ₹739 per quintal was left.","camera":"corridor","focus":[679,675],"route":"dhanotu-kullu","chart":"waterfall"},{"kind":"stress","headline":"Still positive under stress","caption":"With 25% dearer freight, 10% loss and costlier credit, the typical day still kept ₹559 per quintal.","camera":"corridor","focus":[679,675],"route":"dhanotu-kullu","chart":"waterfall"},{"kind":"strategy","headline":"A trader who only knew the morning's news","caption":"Using only the latest available Kullu report, the rule selects 16 of 19 modeled shipping days. 13 had positive modeled net, averaging ₹699 per quintal (₹497 under stress).","camera":"corridor","focus":[679,675],"route":"dhanotu-kullu","chart":"strategy"},{"kind":"conclusion","headline":"The back-test","caption":"The modeled Bottle gourd route from Dhanotu (Mandi) to Kullu was positive on 84% of matched days in October 2025. At that average, a 100-quintal (10-tonne) load implies ₹69,900, or ₹49,700 under stress. Actual buyer, capacity, haggling, rejection and delays are unknown.","camera":"corridor","focus":[679,675],"route":"dhanotu-kullu"}],"assumptions":[{"kind":"sourced","item":"Freight","value":"≈₹240 per quintal Nashik→Delhi","source":"rbi-wps-depr-08-2024"},{"kind":"assumption","item":"Freight for this product","value":"onion survey freight applied per quintal to bottle gourd","source":null},{"kind":"assumption","item":"Freight on other distances","value":"scaled by road km against the 1,115 km Lasalgaon→Azadpur route → ₹18/qtl here","source":null},{"kind":"sourced","item":"Mandi fee + commission","value":"1% + 4% of purchase value","source":"rbi-wps-depr-08-2024"},{"kind":"sourced","item":"Loading/unloading","value":"₹9.02 per quintal","source":"rbi-wps-depr-08-2024"},{"kind":"assumption","item":"Weight & quality loss in transit","value":"5% baseline, 10% adverse","source":null},{"kind":"assumption","item":"Working capital","value":"12% a year (14% adverse) for transit + 7 days","source":null},{"kind":"assumption","item":"Adverse freight","value":"+25% over baseline",